WEBVTT

00:00:27.430 --> 00:00:30.966
from hawkers who were hawking on the streets.

00:00:30.966 --> 00:00:33.768
As a young reporter, I thought that I should do it

00:00:33.768 --> 00:00:37.937
in a different way, so that it has a maximum impact,

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:39.825
since everybody knew that it was happening,

00:00:39.825 --> 00:00:43.394
and yet there was nothing that was keeping it out of the system.

00:00:43.394 --> 00:00:45.629
So I decided to go there

00:00:45.629 --> 00:00:49.594
and act as a seller.

00:00:49.594 --> 00:00:52.847
As part of selling, I was able to document

00:00:52.847 --> 00:00:55.639
the hard core evidence.

00:00:55.639 --> 00:00:58.161
The impact was great.

00:00:58.161 --> 00:01:00.722
It was fantastic.